OL,3,CIndia's education minister resigns
OL,4,Cafter weeks of 'Cockroach' youth
OL,5,Cprotests
OL,7,FIndia's education minister has
OL,8,Fresigned after weeks of protests that
OL,9,Fdemanded his removal.
OL,11,FDharmendra Pradhan faced criticism
OL,12,Fover alleged leaks in some of the
OL,13,Fcountry's most competitive entrance
OL,14,Fexams and testing irregularities.
OL,16,FPradhan announced the decision on
OL,17,FSaturday in a post on X, handing a
OL,18,Fmajor victory to the "Cockroach"
OL,19,Fmovement which had spearheaded
OL,20,Fnationwide demonstrations, sit-ins and
OL,21,Fhunger strikes.
OL,26,@zD@VOUzD@`O]
