OL,3,CIndia's education minister resigns
OL,4,Cafter weeks of 'Cockroach' youth
OL,5,Cprotests
OL,7,FHe wrote: "I hold deep respect for the
OL,8,Faspirations, sentiments, and rightful
OL,9,Fexpectations of the youth of this
OL,10,Fcountry.
OL,12,F"Realising the dreams of India's young
OL,13,Fgeneration has been the moral resolve
OL,14,Fof our political and social life."
OL,16,F"Cockroaches won. Democracy won!" the
OL,17,FCockroach Janta Party, led by Abhijeet
OL,18,FDipke, said on social media.
OL,26,@oD@KOUtD@AOUvD@bO]xD@AOUxD@aO]
