OL,3,CIndia's education minister resigns
OL,4,Cafter weeks of 'Cockroach' youth
OL,5,Cprotests
OL,7,FPradhan's resignation also marks the
OL,8,Ffirst significant concession by Prime
OL,9,FMinister Narendra Modi's government to
OL,10,Fone of the most visible waves of
OL,11,Fpublic dissent it has faced in recent
OL,12,Fyears.
OL,14,FDemonstrations spread nationwide more
OL,15,Fthan a month ago after allegations of
OL,16,Fexam paper leaks.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
