OL,3,CIndia's education minister resigns
OL,4,Cafter weeks of 'Cockroach' youth
OL,5,Cprotests
OL,7,FWhat started as a call for education
OL,8,Freforms, grew into a broader protest
OL,9,Fover unemployment, government
OL,10,Faccountability and economic
OL,11,Fopportunities.
OL,13,FStudents, professionals, families and
OL,14,Factivists have joined rallies in New
OL,15,FDelhi and other cities across India.
OL,17,FNews of Pradhan's resignation sparked
OL,18,Fcelebrations among the thousands of
OL,19,Fprotesters. Many embraced each other
OL,20,Fand waved the Indian flag.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
