OL,3,CIndia's education minister resigns
OL,4,Cafter weeks of 'Cockroach' youth
OL,5,Cprotests
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FLast week, Indian educationist Sonam
OL,13,FWangchuk, on hunger strike for 26
OL,14,Fdays, was forcibly removed from his
OL,15,Fprotest site.
OL,17,FWangchuk consumed nothing but salt and
OL,18,Fwater and lost more than a stone.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
