OL,3,CIndia's education minister resigns
OL,4,Cafter weeks of 'Cockroach' youth
OL,5,Cprotests
OL,7,FPolice and paramilitary personnel
OL,8,Fswooped in on the stage where the
OL,9,Factivist was lying down. Protesters
OL,10,Fwho tried to stop them were pushed
OL,11,Faway.
OL,13,FIn a post on X following Pradhan's
OL,14,Fresignation, Wangchuk congratulated
OL,15,Fthe CJP, Gen Z and all citizens "for
OL,16,Frising up from every corner of the
OL,17,Fnation", adding: "From accountability,
OL,18,Fnow to reforms."
