OL,3,CIndia's education minister resigns
OL,4,Cafter weeks of 'Cockroach' youth
OL,5,Cprotests
OL,7,FTensions escalated on Monday when
OL,8,Fpolice moved to disperse thousands of
OL,9,Fprotesters marching toward Parliament.
OL,10,FSeveral students were injured in the
OL,11,Fcrackdown, intensifying anger among
OL,12,Fthose taking part.
OL,14,FModi's government had announced fast-
OL,15,Ftrack courts for cases involving exam
OL,16,Fpaper leaks, saying it would introduce
OL,17,Flegislation to strengthen measures
OL,18,Fagainst cheating and corruption in the
OL,19,Fexamination system.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
